Package: statinfer
Type: Package
Title: Statistical Inference Toolkit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("RK", email = "tmuxer@disroot.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A from-scratch, pure-R implementation of core statistical
    machinery: descriptive statistics, special functions (erf, gamma),
    probability distributions, classical hypothesis tests, ordinary
    least squares regression, and Bayesian conjugate-prior updating.
    Ported from an equivalent pure-Python toolkit. R6 classes are used
    for object-oriented components (distributions, regression, Bayesian
    models) to mirror the original Python class structure; every formula
    (mean, variance, erf, gamma, OLS, conjugate posteriors, ...) is
    hand-implemented rather than delegated to base R or stats.
License: GPL-2
Encoding: UTF-8
